n></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\">\\(A\\le_T\\varnothing&#39;\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e74d4f391e777166\" href=\"?note=e74d4f391e777166\" title=\"20-thm-low2-domination\">20-thm-low2-domination</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"2e0726b34b0b1c40\" href=\"?note=2e0726b34b0b1c40\" title=\"20-df-domination\">20-df-domination</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonlow2\\text{-}escape}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall g\\in(\\mathcal C_1^{\\varnothing&#39;})^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall N\\\n\\exists x\\ge N\\ [f(x)&gt;g(x)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}nonlow2\\text{-}escape}\\vdash\n\\neg\\operatorname{Low}_2(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall g\\in(\\mathcal C_1^{\\varnothing&#39;})^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n\\exists f\\in(\\mathcal C_1^A)^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\ \\forall N\\\n\\exists x\\ge N\\ [f(x)&gt;g(x)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是支配表征的量词否定。把全函数范围保留在两个量词中，避免“部分函数支配”歧义。</p>\n<p>来源：Corollary 4.6.2；印刷页 98；PDF 第 134 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[